  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Frame anything around you with your hands and AI tells you what it is.
    
    Pinch both hands close together, pull your right hand down diagonally to draw the crop, then release both pinches.
    
    The crop is sent to GPT-4o and its answer appears above it. This Lens needs a Snap token in the Remote Service Gateway Credentials.
